      "messages": {
        "202520000": {
          "id": 202520000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "在前往仙舟的路上，我把《狐狐队大战绒绒号》所有联名店全去了一遍",
          "next": [
            202520001
          ]
        },
        "202520001": {
          "id": 202520001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "吧唧、立牌、手办、防晒霜、充电宝、扫地机器人——全部！拿下！",
          "next": [
            202520002,
            202520003
          ]
        },
        "202520002": {
          "id": 202520002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我是绒绒号警察，绯绯狐你怎么回事，不爱《绒绒号》了吗？",
          "next": [
            202520005
          ]
        },
        "202520003": {
          "id": 202520003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "《狐狐队大战绒绒号》？有版权吗？",
          "next": [
            202520004
          ]
        },
        "202520004": {
          "id": 202520004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "有的有的！听说是二维马老师亲自授权——「就靠各位二创大佬给绒绒号续命啦！」",
          "next": [
            202520005
          ]
        },
        "202520005": {
          "id": 202520005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "《绒绒号》休刊期间，就让人家吃点代餐饱肚子吧！",
          "next": [
            202520006
          ]
        },
        "202520006": {
          "id": 202520006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "不过「吃」得是有点撑…周边买太多了，都不知道放在哪里了",
          "next": [
            202520007
          ]
        },
        "202520007": {
          "id": 202520007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "正当我茫无头绪的时候……",
          "next": [
            202520008
          ]
        },
        "202520008": {
          "id": 202520008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "「狐狐队」队长水冰狐指引了我！",
          "next": [
            202520009
          ]
        },
        "202520009": {
          "id": 202520009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "第二卷中，水冰狐使用了「深井冰冰大冰箱」——让狐狐们藏进冰箱，顺着食物链成功潜入绒绒号！",
          "next": [
            202520010
          ]
        },
        "202520010": {
          "id": 202520010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "深不可测…冰箱居然可以储放食物之外的东西",
          "next": [
            202520011
          ]
        },
        "202520011": {
          "id": 202520011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "于是我立刻下单了十台狐狐队、十台绒绒号联名冰箱",
          "next": [
            202520012
          ]
        },
        "202520012": {
          "id": 202520012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "给我没地方放的漫画和谷子们，一个冰凉的家",
          "next": [
            202520013,
            202520014
          ]
        },
        "202520013": {
          "id": 202520013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "警惕消费主义陷阱",
          "next": [
            202520015
          ]
        },
        "202520014": {
          "id": 202520014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "有那么多东西装吗？警惕消费主义陷阱啊",
          "next": [
            202520017
          ]
        },
        "202520015": {
          "id": 202520015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "好冷漠无情的大人发言，小浣熊，你变了",
          "next": [
            202520016
          ]
        },
        "202520016": {
          "id": 202520016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "我可不是冲动消费",
          "next": [
            202520018
          ]
        },
        "202520017": {
          "id": 202520017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "有的有的，我可不是冲动消费",
          "next": [
            202520018
          ]
        },
        "202520018": {
          "id": 202520018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "一台装首刷版漫画们，一台装典藏版……",
          "next": [
            202520019
          ]
        },
        "202520019": {
          "id": 202520019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "一台装必入款周边们，一台装联名限定……",
          "next": [
            202520020
          ]
        },
        "202520020": {
          "id": 202520020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "一台装电子宠物蛋们，一台装…装……",
          "next": [
            202520021,
            202520022,
            202520023
          ]
        },
        "202520021": {
          "id": 202520021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "别算了，买多了没处用就送我吧",
          "next": [
            202520024
          ]
        },
        "202520022": {
          "id": 202520022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "就从没想过装吃的是吗？让冰箱回归初心吧！",
          "next": [
            202520025
          ]
        },
        "202520023": {
          "id": 202520023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "隔壁神探事务所老狼馋死了",
          "next": [
            202520026
          ]
        },
        "202520024": {
          "id": 202520024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "好主意！其实水冰狐的「深井冰冰大冰箱」最后也是被绒绒号拿下的",
          "next": [
            202520027
          ]
        },
        "202520025": {
          "id": 202520025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "好主意！一台装吃的！",
          "next": [
            202520027
          ]
        },
        "202520026": {
          "id": 202520026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "好主意！一台送不死狼侦探！",
          "next": [
            202520027
          ]
        },
        "202520027": {
          "id": 202520027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "剩下的就全部送给星穹列车！就这样决定了",
          "next": [
            202520028
          ]
        },
        "202520028": {
          "id": 202520028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "你看，都有用处吧~",
          "next": [
            202520029
          ]
        },
        "202520029": {
          "id": 202520029,
          "type": "Sticker",
